@startuml
' SSD – UC-10: Track Order
title SSD – UC-10: Track Order

actor "Buyer" as Buyer
participant "SmartTech System" as System

== View Orders ==

Buyer -> System: 1: viewMyOrders()
activate System

System -> System: 2: retrieveOrdersByBuyer(buyerId, sortBy='createdAt_desc')
System --> Buyer: 3: returnOrderList(orders[])

== View Order Details ==

Buyer -> System: 4: selectOrder(orderId)
System -> System: 5: retrieveOrderDetails(orderId)
System -> System: 6: retrieveFulfilmentStatus(lineItems)
System --> Buyer: 7: returnOrderDetailPage(order, items, statusTimeline)

== Confirm Delivery ==

Buyer -> System: 8: confirmDelivery(orderId)
System -> System: 9: updateOrderStatus('DELIVERED')
System --> Buyer: 10: return statusUpdatedConfirmation()

deactivate System

@enduml